{
    "content1": {
        "content": "When you create a new Flutter project (say with flutter create my_app), it generates many files and folders. Every file and folder has a reason. Let’s break it down layer by layer.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content2": {
        "content": "🌟 Flutter Project Structure (Deep Explanation)",
        "type": "heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content3": {
        "content": "1. android/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content4": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\tNative Android project.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content5": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\tContains code to build and run the app on Android devices.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content6": {
        "content": "Key files/folders inside:",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content7": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\tapp/: Actual Android app (like in native Android Studio projects).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content8": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsrc/main/: Main source files.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content9": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAndroidManifest.xml:App-level configuration (permissions, activities, intent filters).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content10": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tjava/: Native Java/Kotlin code (optional unless you write platform-specific code).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content11": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tres/: Android resources (icons, splash screens, etc.).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content12": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tbuild.gradle:Android app's build settings (version code, SDK versions).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content13": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\tgradle/:Gradle wrapper files (for building project).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content14": {
        "content": "\t\t\t\t\tbuild.gradle (project level):Settings for overall Android build.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content15": {
        "content": "✅ You modify AndroidManifest.xml to add permissions or customize splash.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content16": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content17": {
        "content": "2. ios/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content18": {
        "content": "Native iOS project.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content19": {
        "content": "Contains code to build and run the app on iOS devices.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content20": {
        "content": "Key files/folders inside:",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content21": {
        "content": "Runner/:\nXcode project for the iOS app.\nAppDelegate.swift or AppDelegate.m:\n\t\t\tHandles app lifecycle events at native iOS level.\nInfo.plist:\n\t\t\tiOS equivalent of AndroidManifest (permissions, app name, icons).\n",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content22": {
        "content": "Podfile:\nFor CocoaPods, manages dependencies for iOS.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content23": {
        "content": "✅ You modify Info.plist to add permissions like camera, location, etc.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content24": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content25": {
        "content": "3. lib/ (🔥 Most Important for Flutter developers)",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content26": {
        "content": "Your Dart code lives here.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content27": {
        "content": "Entry point:\n\t\t\tmain.dart\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFirst file loaded.\n\t\t\t\t\t\tTypically has void main() => runApp(MyApp());",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content28": {
        "content": "Common structure inside lib/:",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content29": {
        "content": "screens/:\n\t\t\tSeparate screens/pages (like LoginPage, HomePage, SettingsPage).widgets/:\n\t\t\tReusable UI parts (like buttons, cards, custom lists).\nmodels/:\n\t\t\tData models (like User, Product, etc.).\nservices/:\n\t\t\tAPIs, database services, authentication, etc.\nproviders/ (if using Provider package):\n\t\t\tState management classes.\nutils/:\n\t\t\tHelper functions, constants, themes.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content30": {
        "content": "✅ You will spend 90% of your time inside lib/.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content31": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content32": {
        "content": "4. test/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content33": {
        "content": "Unit tests and widget tests live here.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content34": {
        "content": "Key file initially:\n\t\t\twidget_test.dart\n\t\t\t\t\tBasic test to check if the app shows the default Flutter counter app correctly.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content35": {
        "content": "✅ You can add tests for your UI and business logic here.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content36": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content37": {
        "content": "5. build/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content38": {
        "content": "Generated automatically.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content39": {
        "content": "Compiled files go here when you run the app (flutter build).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content40": {
        "content": "You don’t edit this folder.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content41": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content42": {
        "content": "6. .dart_tool/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content43": {
        "content": "Internal tool folder for Dart & Flutter.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content45": {
        "content": "Contains metadata and dependency info.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content46": {
        "content": "You don’t touch this manually.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content47": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content48": {
        "content": "7. .idea/",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content49": {
        "content": "Only if you are using Android Studio / IntelliJ.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content50": {
        "content": "Stores IDE settings.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content51": {
        "content": "✅ Ignore this if you use VS Code.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content52": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content53": {
        "content": "9. pubspec.yaml (📜 Very Important)",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content54": {
        "content": "Like a manifest of your Flutter app.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content55": {
        "content": "Lists:\n\t\t\tApp name, description.\n\t\t\tFlutter SDK version.\n\t\t\tDependencies (packages you use like provider, http).\n\t\t\tAssets (images, fonts).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content56": {
        "content": "✅ Whenever you add a package or asset, update pubspec.yaml.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content57": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content58": {
        "content": "10. pubspec.lock",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content59": {
        "content": "Auto-generated.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content60": {
        "content": "Locks the exact version of each dependency.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content61": {
        "content": "Helps to ensure consistent builds across devices.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content62": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content63": {
        "content": "11. README.md",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content64": {
        "content": "A markdown file.",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content65": {
        "content": "Project description and instructions (especially useful if others use your code).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content66": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    },
    "content67": {
        "content": "12. .gitignore",
        "type": "sub-heading",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content68": {
        "content": "Lists files/folders that Git should not track (like build/, .dart_tool/).",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "typeOf": "Text"
    },
    "content69": {
        "content": "break",
        "type": "break",
        "typeOf": "break"
    }
}